<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Whirlpool said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Whirlpool said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin Jenrette cut its rating on Whirlpool Corp to underperform from market performer, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- It lowered its 1996 earnings per share estimate for the company to $2.26 from $2.75, the source said.</p>
<p>-- It cut its 1997 EPS view to $3.15 from $3.75, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 50-3/4.</p>
</text>
